    {
      "id": "kinetempo-neck-isometrics",
      "name": "Neck isometrics — four directions",
      "description": "Sit tall. Press the head into your own hand and hold — forehead, then the back of the head, then each temple. Nothing moves: the hand resists exactly as hard as the head pushes. Use about a third of your strength, keep the jaw and shoulders loose, and keep breathing. Ten seconds per direction, five seconds off, three rounds.",
